{#
| Variable                   | Type         | Description                                              |
|----------------------------|--------------|----------------------------------------------------------|
| component                  | object       | merchant settings from twilight.json                     |
| component.title_highlight  | string       | heading's leading word(s), navy                          |
| component.title            | string       | heading rest, deep navy                                  |
| component.use_real_reviews | bool         | the store's real reviews, every written one (default on) |
| component.items            | Collection[] | mock reviews (name, role → the grey line, text, stars) — shown when the switch is off or the store has none |
| component.show_all_link    | bool         | the «عرض جميع التقييمات» link under the rows (default on)  |
| component.bg_color         | string       | panel background, top colour (empty → the design's tint)   |
| component.bg_color2        | string       | panel background, bottom colour (with the first → gradient) |
| component.two_rows         | bool         | two counter-scrolling rows on desktop (default on)       |
| component.speed            | int          | seconds for one card to pass (default 9)                 |
| component.pause_on_hover   | bool         | stop the rows under a mouse (default off)                |
| position                   | int          | sorting block                                            |

Figma "Qusah Re-Vamp", section «Customer reviews · picked»: desktop 503:509,
phone 503:657. A tinted panel: the section's title, then the rows, then the
link to every review. The
rows keep Latafa's behaviour — two counter-scrolling rows on desktop, one on
phones, drag / swipe, optional pause on hover.

Nothing here moves or fills by itself: qissa-testimonials.js (run by home.js)
builds VIRTUAL rows — only the cards that fit, recycled as they scroll out,
filled from the store's reviews page by page — so every written review can
pass through without the page growing. The rows have fixed heights, so the
section never shifts while the reviews load; the card shells show first. The
script also picks the order: the most specific reviews first, one per customer,
the strongest in the navy card.

The mock reviews ride in an inert <template> (Twig-escaped text, never run)
and are copied to a plain array first: on Salla the collection is a one-shot
iterable (the first list operation consumes it — see Latafa's testimonials).
#}
{% set real     = component.use_real_reviews is not defined or component.use_real_reviews is null or component.use_real_reviews %}
{% set two_rows = component.two_rows is not defined or component.two_rows is null or component.two_rows %}
{% set all_link = component.show_all_link is not defined or component.show_all_link is null or component.show_all_link %}

{# the panel's background: both colours → a top-to-bottom gradient, the first alone → one flat
   colour, neither → the design's own tint #}
{% set qtbg = '' %}
{% if component.bg_color and component.bg_color2 %}
    {% set qtbg = 'linear-gradient(180deg, ' ~ component.bg_color ~ ', ' ~ component.bg_color2 ~ ')' %}
{% elseif component.bg_color or component.bg_color2 %}
    {% set qtbg = component.bg_color ?: component.bg_color2 %}
{% endif %}

{% set mock = [] %}
{% for item in component.items %}
    {% if item.text %}{% set mock = mock|merge([item]) %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

<section class="s-block qtest" id="qtest-{{ position }}" data-qtest
         {%- if real %} data-qtest-real{% endif %}
         {%- if component.pause_on_hover %} data-qtest-pause{% endif %}
         data-qtest-speed="{{ component.speed ?: 9 }}"
         data-qtest-anon="{{ trans('blocks.qissa.customer') }}"
         aria-labelledby="qtest-title-{{ position }}"
         {%- if not real and not mock|length %} hidden{% endif %}>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="qtest__panel"{% if qtbg %} style="background: {{ qtbg }};"{% endif %}>

            <h2 class="qtest__title" id="qtest-title-{{ position }}">
                <span class="qtest__title-hl">{{ component.title_highlight }}</span> {{ component.title }}
            </h2>

            {# row two runs the other way; phones show row one only. data-phase = where each row
               starts on desktop (px past the right edge): row one opens on its first card, the
               strongest review, 40 in from the panel's edge; phones use their own 16 #}
            <div class="qtest__rows">
                <div class="qtest__viewport" data-qtest-row data-dir="1" data-phase="-40" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="{{ trans('blocks.qissa.reviews_rows_label') }}"><div class="qtest__track"></div></div>
                {% if two_rows %}
                    <div class="qtest__viewport qtest__viewport--second" data-qtest-row data-dir="-1" data-phase="158" tabindex="0" role="group" aria-label="{{ trans('blocks.qissa.reviews_rows_label') }}"><div class="qtest__track"></div></div>
                {% endif %}
            </div>

            {% if all_link %}
                <div class="qtest__foot-row">
                    <a class="qtest__all" href="{{ link('/testimonials') }}">
                        {{ trans('blocks.qissa.reviews_all') }}
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M19 12H5M11 6l-6 6 6 6"/></svg>
                    </a>
                </div>
            {% endif %}

        </div>
    </div>

    {# one card — the script clones it into the rows' slots #}
    <template data-qtest-card>
        <figure class="qtest__card">
            <div class="qtest__quote-wrap">
                <svg class="qtest__mark" viewBox="0 0 22 18" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M0 18V10C0 4.6 3 1 8.4 0l.9 2.6C6.6 3.5 5.3 5.2 5.2 8H9v10zM12.6 18V10c0-5.4 3-9 8.4-10l.9 2.6c-2.7.9-4 2.6-4.1 5.4h3.8v10z"/></svg>
                <blockquote class="qtest__quote" data-f="text"></blockquote>
            </div>
            {# rtl: the name first (right), the verified mark last (left) #}
            <figcaption class="qtest__foot">
                <div class="qtest__who">
                    <p class="qtest__name" data-f="name"></p>
                    <p class="qtest__meta" data-f="meta"></p>
                </div>
                <span class="qtest__ok" data-f="ok" hidden>
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7.25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M4.8 8.2l2.2 2.2 4.2-4.6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
                    {{ trans('blocks.qissa.reviews_verified') }}
                </span>
            </figcaption>
        </figure>
    </template>

    {# the merchant's mock reviews, as data #}
    <template data-qtest-mock>
        {%- for item in mock -%}
            <p data-name="{{ item.name }}" data-meta="{{ item.role }}" data-stars="{{ item.stars ?: 5 }}">{{ item.text }}</p>
        {%- endfor -%}
    </template>
</section>
